From: amruio <uioamr65@gmail.com>
Date: Wed, 13 Aug 2025 06:15:36 +0300
Subject: [PATCH] Move Background CPUSET to Cores 0-1

Change-Id: Ic50bad0e9edf657dc3d12b9aa1f9048c17e87551
Signed-off-by: Majaahh <maja.blaszczak@proton.me>
---
 init.s5e8825.rc | 1 +
 1 file changed, 1 insertion(+)

diff --git a/init.s5e8825.rc b/init.s5e8825.rc
index a664742..8268bf7 100644
--- a/init.s5e8825.rc
+++ b/init.s5e8825.rc
@@ -961,6 +961,7 @@ on property:sys.boot_completed=1
     write /sys/devices/platform/13500000.ufs/auto_hibern8 2000
 
     write /dev/cpuset/foreground/cpus 0-5
+    write /dev/cpuset/background/cpus 0-1
 
 # KERNEL CORE MEMORY
 on boot
